Cell["Worldlines and observers", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"84707f66-9271-4f77-b1ea-cca7a82d88bc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An ",
 StyleBox["observer",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " is a saturated chain, a directed path of the substrate; its positions are \
the ticks of a clock. A ",
 StyleBox["worldline",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " from ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " to ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " is a longest chain between them, the discrete inertial observer: its \
number of steps is the proper time \[Tau](",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 "). The hierarchy of the chain predicates is light ray \
\[DoubleLongRightArrow] worldline \[DoubleLongRightArrow] observer \
\[DoubleLongRightArrow] chain."
